What is in this repo today (AGPLv3 — not closed source)
------------------------------------------------------
The public tree already includes the guest leak calculator, full behavior
linter, MT4/MT5 CSV parsers, rule-based coach, optional LLM path
(`/api/coach`, `lib/ai`, any OpenAI-compatible host), session review, cloud persist (`lib/persist`,
`/api/run-audit`), and a Telegram helper (`lib/telegram`,
`/api/webhook/telegram`, `/api/profile/telegram`). Those files are open.

What the commercial product charges for
---------------------------------------
Hosted convenience on getriskguard.com: login and go, managed cloud
database, included LLM quota, and a hosted alert process so you do not
run your own 24/7 server. Stripe Checkout / Customer Portal in this
tree (`app/api/checkout`, `app/api/billing/portal`, `app/api/webhook/stripe`)
is how Cloud Pro is billed. Community self-host without Stripe env
vars is not paywalled — the linter stays free.

What is not in this repo yet (future proprietary / hosted modules)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
When they exist, these live outside this AGPLv3 tree:

  - live broker sync / live prop-firm buffer
  - multi-tenant Academy (seats, student grading)
  - managed notification fleet (hosted Telegram/Discord at scale)

Community self-host can still wire your own Supabase, any OpenAI-compatible
LLM (OpenAI, OpenRouter, Ollama, …), and Telegram keys. That is not the same
as the hosted Pro plan.
